# Electron binary + electron-builder binaries mirror (npmmirror)
# 根治跨平台 `npm install` 时 Electron 二进制从 GitHub CDN 下载超时
# (ETIMEDOUT 20.205.243.166:443) 的坑。mac 构建经 dist 脚本的
# ELECTRON_MIRROR env 也走此处；Win/Linux 机 `npm install` 直接读本文件。
electron_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron/
electron_builder_binaries_mirror=https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron-builder-binaries/
